&lt;p&gt;Miss Bess Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Pearl, Ill.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I arrived all O.K. but had to walk from the depot with my basket. I have been looking for you all week. I don’t see why you don’t come down.&lt;br&gt;
From,&lt;br&gt;
Ray&lt;/p&gt;</description>
